y reason to opt out ‎<This message was edited>", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:37:38Z", "username": "Saayu Windows", "text": "Please dont let the number drop less than 12 🙈🤣", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:38:12Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Then we’re back in the game🤣", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:38:24Z", "username": "Saayu Windows", "text": "Yes definitely 🙈", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:39:55Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Great question, Ra’s is underrated", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:46:45Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Say, hypothetically, if I had to put a poll on your favourite Batman villain, which group should I put that in - the movies one, or the books one?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:47:07Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Mooks", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:47:14Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "And I don't want to limit it to one source either - could even be video games", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:47:20Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "No need to call us that", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:47:33Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "If you want to make people angry then do it in movies one and say that comics are not books", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:47:55Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Dange karwaoge ‎<This message was edited>", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:48:35Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Dono me daal do", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:48:45Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "I’d say books, original source material is comics", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:49:14Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Then we can analyse the variance in responses basis where people see it first and if there are different responses in different groups", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:49:33Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Like riddler from the books but joker from the movie", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:50:44Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "That makes the most sense", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:51:05Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Sidhesh, do you work in HR?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:51:08Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Done 😊", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:51:15Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Yes", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:51:41Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "10 points to Pavan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:52:27Z", "username": "Dhruv", "text": "A/b testing?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T18:52:44Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K"